1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,458
The real show is
about to begin, brother.

2
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:06,291
I'm dying to
see if you can

3
00:00:06,333 --> 00:00:08,041
still smile when this is over.

4
00:00:11,083 --> 00:00:13,000
Severin, I truly hope
you become the heir.

5
00:00:13,833 --> 00:00:15,708
Because only then will you be barely

6
00:00:15,708 --> 00:00:17,375
worthy of marrying me.

7
00:00:19,708 --> 00:00:21,250
My lord, if you'll excuse me.

8
00:00:21,708 --> 00:00:23,583
I shall leave you
to your family matters.

9
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,125
Redmond… I'll see you at the wedding.

10
00:00:29,708 --> 00:00:31,458
You said goodbye to everyone here.

11
00:00:32,833 --> 00:00:34,875
Everyone except the man you're supposed to marry.

12
00:00:36,333 --> 00:00:39,375
Livia, you'll pay for that.

13
00:00:39,791 --> 00:00:40,083
Pay?

14
00:00:41,208 --> 00:00:43,041
Talk to me after
you actually become the heir.

15
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:45,500
Only then will you
be worth my attention.

16
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:48,583
You could at least
show respect to my mother.

17
00:00:49,416 --> 00:00:50,583
The mother of a failure?

18
00:00:51,208 --> 00:00:52,750
She doesn't deserve my respect.

19
00:00:54,083 --> 00:00:55,083
Angry, Severin?

20
00:00:55,875 --> 00:00:57,375
Want to break the engagement?

21
00:00:57,833 --> 00:00:58,750
I'd be delighted.

22
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,125
It's okay, Severin.

23
00:01:04,333 --> 00:01:05,875
I don't care about any of that.

24
00:01:06,333 --> 00:01:07,041
How touching.

25
00:01:07,666 --> 00:01:09,500
Then make sure your son shows up to the wedding

26
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:11,750
on time. I'd hate for him to miss the show.

27
00:01:13,208 --> 00:01:14,125
I… I will.

28
00:01:18,833 --> 00:01:23,750
Livia… on our wedding day, I'll crush every bit of your pride.

29
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:25,333
I'll make you understand

30
00:01:25,375 --> 00:01:27,291
exactly who isn't worthy of whom.

31
00:01:28,041 --> 00:01:29,083
Come on, Severin.

32
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,375
The banquet hall awaits.

33
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:33,916
Father's about to name his heir.

34
00:01:35,708 --> 00:01:39,125
Here's hoping your little fantasy comes true tonight!

35
00:01:43,333 --> 00:01:45,583
I've called you all here
today as witnesses.

36
00:01:46,875 --> 00:01:49,458
Because tonight, I must choose.

37
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,375
One of my two sons will inherit everything

38
00:01:54,375 --> 00:01:56,083
the Carter family owns.
